# A story port taking one player takes the party (GateFollow reports the port as a cutscene message, the
# teammate follows once it has settled). The bandit-mine capture dialogue, run by the CLIENT: stripped, given
# the miner's shirt and ported into the mine - the host must end up beside them.

include session.coop
set olaf 52b3d368-a4c0-4a62-9542-1f597c3e669b

A expect teammate <= 500 timeout=5
B tpnear $olaf 0 80
sleep 3
B talk $olaf DT_TeleportToBanditMine
B skip

# The capture carried B far away. A's own view of B's body can lag the port, so A's distance only means
# something once A says it followed.
B expect teammate >= 3000 timeout=20
B expect run coop_status contains "1 own story port(s) told to teammates" timeout=5
A expect run coop_status contains "brought along 1 time(s)" timeout=40
A expect teammate <= 500 timeout=10
